# What the security scan reads.
#
# The rule packs are aimed at the code that ships. Test files reach the local
# mock over http and carry fixtures, so the packs' HTTP and credential patterns
# fire on them by construction rather than because of a defect. Scoping them
# out is not a silence: a real pattern in production code still fails the job.
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/__tests__/**
